-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 17.6.2009 (הסתדרות המורים) — הפחתת שכר באמצעות דחיית
-- מועד עדכון שכר: the teachers' share of the 2009 crisis measures, between
-- the State and הסתדרות המורים. Whom it covers — every teaching-scale
-- employee of the State, and another public employer's who joins (§2); the
-- reduction itself — the last step of the 2008 wage supplement of the
-- agreement of 21.2.2008 (its §4(א)(3)) and the completing update of the
-- reform tables of the agreement of 25.12.2008 (its §35(ב)(1), and §47's
-- dates with it) put off from December 2009 to October 2011 (§3(א)); not
-- for end-of-employment payments and budgetary pensions (§3(ב)), but so for
-- provident funds (§3(ג)); entry into force once the havraa statute is
-- enacted (§4); earlier agreements, §155(א) of 25.12.2008 untouched (§5);
-- and the follow-up committee (§6).
--
-- AN AMENDMENT ENCODES WHAT IT CHANGES AND IMPORTS THE REST: the agreement
-- of 21.2.2008 (l4/agreements/teachers-general/2008-02-21_teachers_tosefet-2008_wage-supplement.l4)
-- and §§35, 47 and 155 of the base agreement of 25.12.2008 are imported, and
-- what this one moves is defined here, dated, beside what it moves.
--
-- ITS ROUND is the 2009 crisis agreements of the general public sector,
-- which halve the havraa pay of the scales the Histadrut represents (the
-- framework agreement of 16.6.2009, imported for the statute both wait on,
-- and its amendment of 7.6.2010). The teachers' share is this deferral
-- instead; held against the 2008 frame it gives up, month by month, in
-- l4/tests/2009-06-17_teachers_wage-update-deferral-tests.l4.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT budget_foundations_law
IMPORT `2008-02-21_teachers_tosefet-2008_wage-supplement`
IMPORT `2009-06-16_framework-agreement_public-sector_havraa-reduction`
IMPORT `base-agreement-35`
IMPORT `base-agreement-47`
IMPORT `base-agreement-155`

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — הפחתת שכר באמצעות דחיית מועד עדכון שכר (הסתדרות המורים, 17.6.2009)`

DECLARE `2009 deferral action` IS ONE OF
    `join the 2009 deferral agreement by signing it`
    `tell the chief labour-relations officer in writing that it joins the 2009 deferral agreement`
    `decide a dispute over the 2009 deferral agreement`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 A fax banner; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The registration stamp, its year and number partly illegible; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 "Between"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The State and who represents it (the wages commissioner and the Ministry's Director-General); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The State's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 "And"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 הסתדרות המורים and its secretary-general; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 The union's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 A recital: the economy is hit by the world economic crisis.
-- akn:preamble/p14 A recital: the crisis must be met with the employees' part, freeing sources in the State's budget.
-- akn:preamble/p16 A recital: the parties set the understandings down in a collective agreement.
-- akn:preamble/p17 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p18 A fax banner; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p19 A fax banner; no rule.

-- ¶4: the day of signing, the day written in by hand.
@ref akn:preamble/p4
`the 2009 deferral agreement was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 17 6 2009

-- ¶15: the understandings reached are a reduction of pay by putting off the
-- date of the pay update the teachers' collective agreements set. The
-- agreement says, in its own words, that it gives less.
@ref akn:preamble/p15
`the 2009 deferral agreement says it reduces pay` MEANS TRUE

§§ `1 המבוא`

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
`the 2009 deferral agreement's preamble is part of it` MEANS TRUE

§§ `2 תחולת ההסכם`

@desc A teaching employee and his employer, as far as the agreement of 17.6.2009 asks.
DECLARE `2009 deferral teacher` HAS
    `in the teaching scale, for the 2009 deferral` IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed in the State's service, for the 2009 deferral` IS A BOOLEAN
    `his employing body, for the 2009 deferral` IS AN `employing body` @desc as the Budget Foundations Law's sections 21 and 32 tell bodies apart
    `employed by a funded education institution, for the 2009 deferral` IS A BOOLEAN @desc "מוסד חינוך" of the Compulsory Education Law section 1 whose budget the government shares, directly or not
    `employed by a funded teacher-training institution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc a teacher-training institution whose budget the government shares, directly or not
    `his employer joined the 2009 deferral agreement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc it added its signature, or told the chief labour-relations officer in writing (annex א's form)

-- (ב) ¶2: "מעסיק ציבורי" is one of four: a budgeted body (Budget Foundations
-- Law §21) and a supported body (§32), both imported; an education
-- institution of the Compulsory Education Law that the government funds,
-- and a teacher-training institution it funds — facts of the case (that
-- law is outside the corpus).
@ref akn:art_2__para_b/p2 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_3 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_4
GIVEN t IS A `2009 deferral teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `employed by a public employer in the 2009 deferral's sense` t IF
        `is a budgeted body` (t's `his employing body, for the 2009 deferral`)
    OR `is a supported body` (t's `his employing body, for the 2009 deferral`)
    OR t's `employed by a funded education institution, for the 2009 deferral`
    OR t's `employed by a funded teacher-training institution`

`why the Compulsory Education Law is not in the 2009 deferral` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק לימוד חובה, התש\"ט-1950, סעיף 1"

-- (א): every teaching-scale employee in the State's service ("עובדי
-- הוראה"); (ב): the union consents to its applying to the teaching
-- employees of another public employer that joins it, by signing or by
-- written notice to the chief labour-relations officer.
@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2__para_a akn:art_2__para_b
GIVEN t IS A `2009 deferral teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2009 deferral agreement applies to` t IF
        t's `in the teaching scale, for the 2009 deferral`
    AND (    t's `employed in the State's service, for the 2009 deferral`
         OR (    `employed by a public employer in the 2009 deferral's sense` t
             AND t's `his employer joined the 2009 deferral agreement`))

`joining the 2009 deferral agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MAY   `join the 2009 deferral agreement by signing it`

`joining the 2009 deferral agreement by notice` MEANS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MAY   `tell the chief labour-relations officer in writing that it joins the 2009 deferral agreement`

-- The form of the notice is annexed as annex א; the scan holds the
-- agreement's three pages and not the annex.
`why the 2009 deferral's notice form is not here` MEANS
    `the text is missing` "נספח א' להסכם מיום 17.6.2009 (נוסח ההודעה של מעסיק ציבורי המצטרף להסכם): אינו בסריקה"

§§ `3 הפחתת שכר באמצעות דחיית מועד עדכון שכר`

-- (א)(1): in §4(א)(3) of the agreement of 21.2.2008, "the salary of
-- October 2011" for "the salary of December 2009": the completion to 5% is
-- put off by 22 salary months, and the supplement stays at 3% from December
-- 2009 to September 2011. (א)(1) amends (א)(3) alone; (ז)(3), the shekel
-- supplements' completion to 5%, it leaves as printed (finding F-hh-2009-b,
-- convention reading.as-printed).
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3__para_a akn:art_3__para_a__subpara_1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate on, as amended on 17.6.2009` d IS
    BRANCH IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2011) THEN 5%
           IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2008) THEN 3%
           IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2008) THEN 1.5%
           OTHERWISE 0

GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate as amended on 17.6.2009` c IS
    `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate on, as amended on 17.6.2009` (c's `the salary month`)

-- The shekel supplements' update, (ז) of 21.2.2008, as this agreement
-- leaves it: (א)(1) names (א)(3) alone (convention reading.as-printed).
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the shekel update rate as amended on 17.6.2009` c IS
    `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim shekel update rate after §4(יא)` c

GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the months the 2009 deferral holds back` c IF
        `the salary month is at least` c 2009 12
    AND NOT `the salary month is at least` c 2011 10

-- F-hh-2009-a: §4(יא) of the agreement of 21.2.2008, which this agreement
-- leaves as it is, corrects (א)'s dates to the general agreement's where
-- they are earlier, and the framework of 17.4.2008 completes its frame to
-- 5% on 1.12.2009 — so read literally, (יא) brings (א)(3) back to December
-- 2009 and undoes the deferral. The reading (convention
-- precedence.specific): the deferral, which names (א)(3) and the date, and
-- says it reduces pay, prevails over (יא)'s general correction for the
-- months it holds back; in every other month (יא) works as before.
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the rate (יא) would give over the deferred (א)` c IS
    max (`the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate as amended on 17.6.2009` c) (`the 2008 framework cost frame on` (c's `the salary month`))

GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate as amended on 17.6.2009, after §4(יא)` c IS
    IF `in the months the 2009 deferral holds back` c
    THEN `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate as amended on 17.6.2009` c
    ELSE `the rate (יא) would give over the deferred (א)` c

-- (א)(2): in §35(ב)(1) of the base agreement of 25.12.2008, "1.10.2011"
-- for "1.12.09" — the update completing the reform tables to 3% over the
-- interim agreement's tables; and §47's dates are amended to match: §47
-- converts X again at each date of §4 of the agreement of 21.2.2008, and
-- the date of its (א)(3) is now October 2011.
@ref akn:art_3__para_a__subpara_2
`the completing update falls on, as amended on 17.6.2009` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2011

#ASSERT `the completing update falls on` EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2009

`the dates §47 converts X at, as amended on 17.6.2009` MEANS
    LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2008, DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2008, DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2011

-- §47 (imported) converts at each date on X raised by (א)'s rate on that
-- day; as amended, at (א)(3)'s new date and rate. Its example as amended:
-- X of 7,000 at 17% converts at the third date to 8,599.50, now on
-- 1.10.2011 and no longer on 1.12.2009.
GIVEN x IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `A on a date of §47, as amended on 17.6.2009` x y d IS
    `A at a later date` x y (`the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate on, as amended on 17.6.2009` d)

#ASSERT `A on a date of §47` 7000 17 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2009) EQUALS 8599.5
#ASSERT `A on a date of §47, as amended on 17.6.2009` 7000 17 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2009) EQUALS `A at a later date` 7000 17 (3%)
#ASSERT `A on a date of §47, as amended on 17.6.2009` 7000 17 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2011) EQUALS 8599.5

-- (ב): what is not paid because of the deferral does not count against the
-- teacher in computing payments for the end of employment, nor in the
-- budgetary pensions paid to pensioners — those are computed at the rates
-- as before the deferral. (ג): it does count in the sums paid into a
-- provident fund for him — they are made on the reduced pay. ¶2: a
-- provident fund as the Supervision of Financial Services (Provident Funds)
-- Law, 2005, defines it (outside the corpus).
@ref akn:art_3__para_b akn:art_3__para_c akn:art_3__para_c/p2
DECLARE `what the 2009 deferral asks a rate for` IS ONE OF
    `the month's pay, under the 2009 deferral`
    `payments for the end of employment, under the 2009 deferral`
    `a budgetary pension, under the 2009 deferral`
    `provident-fund contributions, under the 2009 deferral`

GIVEN p IS A `what the 2009 deferral asks a rate for`, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 supplement rate the 2009 deferral counts for` p c IS
    IF p EQUALS `payments for the end of employment, under the 2009 deferral`
       OR p EQUALS `a budgetary pension, under the 2009 deferral`
    THEN `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate after §4(יא)` c
    ELSE `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate as amended on 17.6.2009, after §4(יא)` c

`why the Provident Funds Law is not in the 2009 deferral` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק הפיקוח על שירותים פיננסיים (קופות גמל), התשס\"ה-2005"

-- akn:art_3__para_c/p3 A fax banner; no rule.
-- akn:art_3__para_c/p4 A fax banner; no rule.

-- The agreement of 21.2.2008's claim on the 2008 supplement as this
-- agreement amends it: for a teaching employee that agreement covers, from
-- the salary of January 2008; where the case is one of the populations the
-- deferral reaches (the shared case's `in a population whose 5% step was
-- put off`), at the deferred rate.
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008 as amended on 17.6.2009` c IS
    IF `a teaching employee of the agreement of 21.2.2008` c AND `the salary month is at least` c 2008 1
    THEN JUST ((IF c's `in a population whose 5% step was put off`
                THEN `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate as amended on 17.6.2009, after §4(יא)` c
                ELSE `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate after §4(יא)` c)
               TIMES `the base of the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement` c)
    ELSE NOTHING

`the agreement of 17.6.2009` MEANS
    `instrument` WITH
        `module`        IS "2009-06-17_teachers_wage-update-deferral"
        `title`         IS "ההסכם הקיבוצי מיום 17.6.2009 (הסתדרות המורים)"
        `kind`          IS `a collective agreement`
        `is the takanon` IS FALSE
        `issued`        IS DATE_FROM_DMY 17 6 2009
        `practised for all state employees` IS FALSE
        `approved by the Finance Minister`  IS FALSE

§§ `4 תחילה`

-- In force once the legislation of the partial-havraa statute of 2009 is
-- complete — the statute the framework agreement of 16.6.2009 waits on too
-- (its §6, imported); the day is an input.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4/p1
GIVEN `the havraa statute's legislation was completed` IS A DATE, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2009 deferral agreement is in force on` `the havraa statute's legislation was completed` d IF
    d `is on or after` `the havraa statute's legislation was completed`

`why the havraa statute is not in the 2009 deferral` MEANS `why the statute's enactment is an input`

§§ `5 הסכמים קודמים`

-- ¶1: earlier terms stand unless this agreement changes them; ¶2: it takes
-- nothing from §155(א) of the agreement of 25.12.2008 (imported): the cost
-- of a later framework agreement is still negotiated for the teachers.
@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5/p1
`earlier terms stand unless the 2009 deferral agreement changes them` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:art_5/p2
`the 2009 deferral leaves §155(א) as it is` MEANS
    `may be negotiated` `the cost of a framework agreement`

#ASSERT `the 2009 deferral leaves §155(א) as it is`

§§ `6 הכרעה בחילוקי דעות`

-- A joint parity follow-up committee — the wages commissioner, the union's
-- secretary-general and the Ministry's Director-General — follows the
-- agreement and decides disputes over it unanimously; ¶2: finally, binding
-- the parties.
@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6/p1
`deciding disputes over the 2009 deferral agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the parity committee`
    MAY   `decide a dispute over the 2009 deferral agreement`

@ref akn:art_6/p2
`the 2009 deferral committee's decisions are final and bind the parties` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signing formula; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The parties signing; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p3 A fax banner; no rule.

§§ `findings`

`a teacher of the State in December 2009, put off` MEANS
    `teaching case` WITH
        `the salary month`                IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2009
        `employer`                        IS `employed by the State`
        `in post-primary education`       IS FALSE
        `in the upper division`           IS FALSE
        `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS FALSE
        `in a population whose 5% step was put off` IS TRUE
        `combined salary today`           IS 10000
        `supplement 2001 today`           IS 300
        `combined salary in December 2007` IS 10000
        `supplement 2001 in December 2007` IS 300
        `the kind of school`              IS `another school`
        `the interns the teacher mentors` IS 0
        `the classes in each grade`       IS 0
        `the roles the teacher holds`     IS 0
        `a further role approved by the district manager` IS FALSE

-- F-hh-2009-a's evidence: in December 2009 the deferred (א)(3) leaves 3%,
-- and (יא), read as printed, would restore the framework's 5%.
`§4(יא) of 21.2.2008, read as printed, would undo the deferral` MEANS
        `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate as amended on 17.6.2009` `a teacher of the State in December 2009, put off` EQUALS 3%
    AND `the rate (יא) would give over the deferred (א)` `a teacher of the State in December 2009, put off` EQUALS 5%

#ASSERT `§4(יא) of 21.2.2008, read as printed, would undo the deferral`

-- F-hh-2009-b's evidence: in December 2009 the supplement is held back at
-- 3% while (ז)(3), which (א)(1) does not name, completes the shekel
-- supplements to 5%.
`the deferral holds back the supplement and not the shekel supplements` MEANS
        `the 2008 Histadrut HaMorim supplement rate as amended on 17.6.2009, after §4(יא)` `a teacher of the State in December 2009, put off` EQUALS 3%
    AND `the shekel update rate as amended on 17.6.2009` `a teacher of the State in December 2009, put off` EQUALS 5%

#ASSERT `the deferral holds back the supplement and not the shekel supplements`

§§ `examples`

#ASSERT `the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008 as amended on 17.6.2009` `a teacher of the State in December 2009, put off` EQUALS JUST 309
#ASSERT `the 2008 supplement rate the 2009 deferral counts for` `a budgetary pension, under the 2009 deferral` `a teacher of the State in December 2009, put off` EQUALS 5%
#ASSERT `the 2008 supplement rate the 2009 deferral counts for` `provident-fund contributions, under the 2009 deferral` `a teacher of the State in December 2009, put off` EQUALS 3%

`a State teacher, for the 2009 deferral` MEANS
    `2009 deferral teacher` WITH
        `in the teaching scale, for the 2009 deferral` IS TRUE
        `employed in the State's service, for the 2009 deferral` IS TRUE
        `his employing body, for the 2009 deferral` IS `the State as an employing body`
        `employed by a funded education institution, for the 2009 deferral` IS FALSE
        `employed by a funded teacher-training institution` IS FALSE
        `his employer joined the 2009 deferral agreement` IS FALSE

`a funded college's teacher whose employer did not join` MEANS
    `2009 deferral teacher` WITH
        `in the teaching scale, for the 2009 deferral` IS TRUE
        `employed in the State's service, for the 2009 deferral` IS FALSE
        `his employing body, for the 2009 deferral` IS `another employer`
        `employed by a funded education institution, for the 2009 deferral` IS FALSE
        `employed by a funded teacher-training institution` IS TRUE
        `his employer joined the 2009 deferral agreement` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the 2009 deferral agreement applies to` `a State teacher, for the 2009 deferral`
#ASSERT NOT `the 2009 deferral agreement applies to` `a funded college's teacher whose employer did not join`
#ASSERT `employed by a public employer in the 2009 deferral's sense` `a funded college's teacher whose employer did not join`
